  "title": "Kakushite Kisetsu wa Ao wo Shiru",
  "description": "Sano Natsuo, a high school student who wants to keep his dream of becoming a shoujo mangaka a secret, suddenly bumps into Harumiya Hina—a mysterious, beautiful girl with a somewhat peculiar personality, wearing a flashy t-shirt, and packing a voracious appetite!\n\nHowever, they just can’t seem to get along! Tense, nervous, and utterly incompatible, their communication is a total mess. What could Hina’s secret plan to secure a serialization contract possibly be…?\n\n“W-Wait, you don’t mean… What if we start dating?!”\n\nA story of youth driven by the desire to depict “love” unleashes itself. An unpredictable and wild romantic comedy begins!",
